time=2026-08-10T08:48:43.137-03:00 level=INFO msg="tui action ok" message="Running `/hero-sync`: I'll read workflow config and project context, then launch `context_agent` to scan the codebase.\nScanning product and architecture docs for pending items and running `hero doctor`.\nShell isn't available in this session, so I'll update Hero artifacts from the context scan and note that `hero doctor` should be run locally.\n→ Scanning codebase for Hero sync...\n→ Generating AGENTS.md, current-state.md, context-log.md...\n→ Scanning docs/product and docs/architecture for pending items...\n→ Running hero doctor for harness warnings...\n\n**Sync summary**\n\n**Context scan** (`context_agent`, model `composer-2.5`): Hero **1.0.0** is feature-complete. Cycles C1–C3 are archived; no active cycle. Scope: `backend` + `script` + `infrastructure`; no frontend/native.\n\n**Artifacts**\n\n| File | Action |\n|---|---|\n| `AGENTS.md` | Verified — complete with doc map, context files, workflow, testing, constraints, secrets |\n| `context/current-state.md` | Updated — merged 2 technical-debt items from docs scan |\n| `context/context-log.md` | Appended sync entry |\n| `.env.example` / `.gitignore` | Verified — secrets hygiene in place (not overwritten) |\n| `.workflow-hero/config/project.json` | Updated — `lastSyncAt`, `activeCycle: null` |\n\n**Pending docs scan (ADR-029)**\n\nExisting pending items (v1.0.0 release, D1–D13, V2 scope, `hero upgrade`) were already captured. **New merges** into `## Known Technical Debt`:\n\n- GPG-signed release artifacts deferred to V2 (PRD §7; DEPLOY.md)\n- Upstream Cursor CLI gaps: plugin skills, nested skill dirs (ADR-C02)\n\n**`hero doctor` (warn-only)**\n\nCould not run in this agent shell. Run locally:\n\n```bash\ngo run ./cmd/hero doctor\n```\n\nExpected warnings based on current state:\n\n- **`version-match`**: `hero.json` records **0.9.0** while CLI source is **1.0.0** — run `hero upgrade` to align\n- **Harness markers**: no `.claude/` / `.windsurf/` / `.codex/` detected; `.cursor/` matches `hero.json` → `cli.tools: cursor`\n- **Secrets hygiene**: `.env.example` present; `.gitignore` ignores `.env`\n\nKeep real secrets in local `.env` only — never commit them.\n\n✓ Hero sync complete. Review the generated files before starting a development cycle.\n→ Run `/hero-todos` to review pending items, or `/hero-new` to start your first cycle."
time=2026-08-10T08:49:40.339-03:00 level=INFO msg="tui action ok" message="→ Pending items (from context/current-state.md)\n\n• Publish GitHub Release **`v1.0.0`** (binaries + `checksums.txt`).\n• `.workflow-hero/config/hero.json` still records `cli.version` / `assets.version` **0.9.0** while CLI default is **1.0.0** — run `hero upgrade` to align.\n• Post-1.0 deferred **D1–D13** (multi-harness adapters, integrations, notification manager, rich TUI, daemon/RPC, event bus, markdown projections, etc. — see PRD-C01 §4).\n• V2 scope per PRD §2.3 / §7: Windows CLI, CI/CD-automated releases, GPG-signed artifacts, non-interactive-only CLI, additional harnesses (OpenCode, Claude Code, Codex, VS Code), advanced sync/drift detection, optional stages (UX, observability, security review), AI hooks, richer project memory (RAG/DB).\n• Note: intermediate tags `v0.6.0`–`v0.7.0` never published on GitHub; `v0.8.0` / `v0.9.0` published.\n\n⚠ If docs/product or docs/architecture changed, run /hero-sync then /hero-todos to refresh."
